# 詞: 銀包

1. 我嘅銀包入面冇錢，只有一張舊嘅優惠券。 (There's no money in my wallet, only an old coupon.)
2. 佢咁大嘅銀包，裝咗幾多嘢啊？ (His wallet is so big, what did he stuff inside it?)
3. 我買咗新銀包，用嚟畀妹妹生日畀。 (I bought a new wallet to give my sister for her birthday.)
4. 銀包落喺地上咗，我快要哭出嚟。 (My wallet fell on the ground, I almost cried.)
5. 你嘅銀包入面有冇八達？ (Do you have an Octopus card in your wallet?)
6. 佢嘅銀包都係偷嚟嘅，唔好同佢講。 (His wallet was stolen, don't talk to him about it.)
7. 我嘅銀包袋袋都破咗，要換一個。 (The zipper of my wallet is broken, I need a new one.)
8. 她嘅銀包入面放咗一張照片同一枚小貝。 (She put a photo and a small bead in her wallet.)
9. 銀包入面嘅錢，我都畀咗你咗。 (All the money in my wallet, I gave it to you already.)
10. 你行街要留意，銀包唔好露喺外面。 (When you walk on the street, be careful, don't leave your wallet exposed.) [end of text]


